			<div class="content" id="post-content-1865588">
									

<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">You need to change the SCP-XXXXs, the top of the page should be &quot;SCP-1431&quot; not &quot;Scp 1431&quot;.</span></p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-XXXX is a 26.6&#160;cm x 20.3&#160;cm piece of paper presumably torn from a note-book.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Standard notebook paper is 21.59&#160;cm x 27.94&#160;cm (8.5 x 11 inches). Your paper is 10.47244 x 7.992126 inches. This doesn't seem like any notebook.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>It has become apparent that there is always one item, which involves some form of mass genocide or hellish destruction.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This sounds unscientific. As a general rule of thumb, &quot;hellish&quot; is not a scientific term.</p>
<p>Frankly I just don't find this interesting; it's a scavenger hunt that tries to get people to kill stuff via promises of eternal life.</p>
<p>-1</p>

